  system_should: |
    Let a person record one action that covers a set of wells ("A1 to A12, 50 µL each") and expand it into well-level entries. Reject or flag a transfer that would push the source below zero, and show which source was likely meant. Allow an intermediate trough as a short-lived container, or allow the bottle to be the source directly.
  question_it_answers: Where did the buffer in this well come from?
  frequency: many-per-day
  cost_if_wrong: medium
  cost_reason: Buffer is cheap, but a wrong source breaks lineage when a buffer lot goes bad
  depth: core
  sim_hook: |
    Actor scientist, action manual_transfer(src, dest_wells, vol). Errors: wrong_source_scan p≈0.02, wrong_row_offset p≈0.01, skip_intermediate_container p≈0.30.
  source: brief

