codex
The catalog already covers failed scans and disposal with liquid left inside. Today also shows a useful variant of movement tracking: the final storage locations were right, but the records missed more than five hours on the bench. The plate search and stock forecast remain unresolved; neither the empty lookup nor the missing usage history proves that plates were lost or stock was insufficient.
